# No Local Testing

Do not test locally.

- Do not start local servers (`node server.js`, `scripts/dev.js`, static file servers).
- Do not open the game in a local or headless browser.
- Do not write or run local test harnesses or test scripts.

Checks that stay allowed because they do not run the game: the type-check (`node node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc --noEmit -p .`), the build and `node --check` on server files.

The user tests on the deployed build. End the task by listing what has to be checked there.
